{
  "_comment": "Pins the objection-authorized decline on a Passed tally (RFC-MACP-0007 Section 6.2). The existing finalize_decline fixtures cover the empty tally and an unmet quorum; none covers a tally that Passed, the case where the tri-state gate and the decline guard would both deny.",
  "description": "Decision Mode: finalize_decline authorizes a negative commitment even when the vote Passed and no REJECT was cast.",
  "mode": "macp.mode.decision.v1",
  "initiator": "agent://orchestrator",
  "participants": [
    "agent://orchestrator",
    "agent://a",
    "agent://b",
    "agent://c"
  ],
  "mode_version": "1.0.0",
  "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
  "policy": {
    "policy_id": "policy.decision.objection-decline-passed",
    "mode": "macp.mode.decision.v1",
    "schema_version": 3,
    "description": "Majority vote; critical objections veto and finalize as a decline; allow_decline_over_approval false.",
    "rules": {
      "voting": {
        "algorithm": "majority"
      },
      "objection_handling": {
        "critical_severity_vetoes": true,
        "critical_objection_action": "finalize_decline"
      },
      "commitment": {
        "authority": "initiator_only",
        "allow_decline_over_approval": false
      }
    }
  },
  "policy_version": "policy.decision.objection-decline-passed",
  "ttl_ms": 60000,
  "messages": [
    {
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Proposal",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.ProposalPayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "option": "deploy",
        "rationale": "ready",
        "supporting_data": []
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Placed before the first Vote, because Section 5 rule 6 closes deliberation when voting begins.",
      "sender": "agent://c",
      "message_type": "Objection",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.ObjectionPayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "reason": "unresolved security finding",
        "severity": "critical"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://a",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "APPROVE",
        "reason": "ballot"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://b",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "APPROVE",
        "reason": "ballot"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "The tally is Passed (2 of 2 decisive votes approve), but the standing critical objection vetoes the positive direction.",
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c1",
        "outcome_positive": true,
        "action": "decision.selected",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "commit",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.decision.objection-decline-passed",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "POLICY_DENIED"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "THE DISCRIMINATOR. RFC-MACP-0007 Section 6.2: an objection-authorized decline is not gated by the tri-state and is not subject to the decline guard. Gated as a vote-authorized commitment, this message would be denied on two grounds: the Passed arm denies a negative commitment because allow_decline_over_approval is false, and the decline guard fails because no REJECT was cast. It must be accepted, because its authorization is the recorded critical Objection.",
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c2",
        "outcome_positive": false,
        "action": "decision.rejected",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "commit",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.decision.objection-decline-passed",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    }
  ],
  "expected_final_state": "Resolved",
  "expect_resolution_present": true,
  "expected_resolution": {
    "action": "decision.rejected",
    "mode_version": "1.0.0",
    "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
    "outcome_positive": false
  },
  "expected_mode_state": {
    "phase": "Committed",
    "objections": [
      {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "severity": "critical",
        "sender": "agent://c"
      }
    ],
    "votes": {
      "p1": {
        "agent://a": {
          "vote": "APPROVE"
        },
        "agent://b": {
          "vote": "APPROVE"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
